      <h1>What Is Bitcoin Knots?</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Bitcoin Knots is an open-source Bitcoin node and wallet implementation derived from Bitcoin Core. It shares substantial upstream code while publishing separate releases and carrying additional, retained, or differently configured features. Comparisons must name exact versions and configurations because policy, interface, wallet, and even consensus-related behavior can change between releases.</p>
      <ul class="msc-learn-page-meta"><li>Bitcoin Core</li><li>Deep</li><li>Comparative Technical Explainer</li><li>14 to 17 minutes</li><li>Reviewed 2026-07-25</li></ul>
